 "name_en": "Cash Application Integration (1MV)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>Cash Application Integration (1MV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">The SAP Cash Application uses the past data in your system to propose invoice matching prediction results. It helps lower the manual effort in the time-consuming clearing process of open items.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">With this scope item, remittance advice can also be created automatically by the system based on the advice file sent from your customers or payees.</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">To use this solution's functions, you must purchase the extra license on SAP BTP.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Extract unstructured remittance advice data and make it available to be used for standard clearing process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extract and replicate historical data to Machine Learning Platform as machine training data</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Extract and replicate open receivable items to Machine Learning Platform for scoring</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Perform payables line-item matching – Self-initiated</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Get automated training process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reprocess bank statement by matching the open receivable items to the proposed bank statement</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Save effort in this labor-intensive process</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Consume the fully integrated business process easily with the SAP Cash Application solution</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>现金应用集成 (1MV)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">SAP Cash Application 使用系统中的过去数据建议发票匹配预测结果。这有助于减少耗时的未清项目清算流程中的手动工作量。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">通过此范围项目，系统还可以根据从客户或收款人发送的通知文件自动创建汇款通知。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">要使用此解决方案的功能，您必须在 SAP BTP 上购买额外的许可证。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">提取非结构化汇款通知数据，并使其可用于标准清算流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提取历史数据并将其复制到机器学习平台，作为机器训练数据</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">提取未清应收账款项目并将其复制到机器学习平台，以进行评分</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">执行应付账款行项目匹配 - 自发起</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">获取自动化训练流程</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过将未清应收账款项目与建议的银行对账单进行匹配，重新处理银行对账单</li>\n      </ul>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n      <p class=\"p\"></p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loioc12b1c66ee934ff8929aa35d81e29d65__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">节省劳动密集型流程中的工作量</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">通过 SAP Cash Application 解决方案轻松使用完全集成的业务流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
